* ============================================================
* CURSOR_FAMILY_REGRESSION_001_CDX_SANDBOX.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Regression for core cursor/navigation commands after
*   nav-layer/order-iterator repairs.
*
* Scope:
*   - Physical / natural order
*   - v64 CDX/LMDB ordered traversal
*   - TOP / BOTTOM
*   - GO / GOTO
*   - SKIP
*   - SEEK
*
* Notes:
*   - Uses AREA to verify current cursor position.
*   - Uses TUPLE to verify the actual current record.
*   - Uses SMARTLIST only to verify display/order samples.
*   - Does not use LIST to prove TOP/BOTTOM or ordered movement.
*   - Assumes SANDBOX STUDENTS.dbf exists.
*   - Assumes STUDENTS.cdx exists with at least tags:
*         LNAME
*         FNAME
*         SID
* ============================================================

SET ECHO OFF

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO CURSOR FAMILY REGRESSION 001 - CDX SANDBOX
ECHO ============================================================

DO SANDBOX
WORKSPACE OPEN DBF
SELECT STUDENTS

ECHO --- SECTION 1: Physical baseline ---
SET ORDER TO 0
AREA
STATUS
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5

ECHO --- SECTION 2: Physical TOP ---
TOP
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 3: Physical BOTTOM ---
BOTTOM
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 4: Physical GOTO absolute ---
GOTO 10
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 5: Physical GO absolute ---
GO 25
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 6: Physical GO TOP / GO BOTTOM ---
GO TOP
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO BOTTOM
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 7: Physical SKIP forward/backward ---
GO TOP
SKIP 5
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SKIP -2
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 8: Physical GO relative (+/-n) ---
GO TOP
GO +7
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO -3
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 9: Physical boundary checks ---
GO TOP
SKIP -1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO BOTTOM
SKIP 1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 10: Physical SEEK explicit field form ---
SET ORDER TO 0
SEEK ANDERSON IN LNAME
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO --- CDX/LMDB ORDERED TESTS ---
ECHO ============================================================

ECHO --- SECTION 11: Activate CDX LNAME tag ---
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
ASCEND
AREA
STATUS
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5

ECHO --- SECTION 12: CDX LNAME TOP ascending ---
TOP
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5

ECHO --- SECTION 13: CDX LNAME BOTTOM ascending ---
BOTTOM
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 14: CDX LNAME GO TOP / GO BOTTOM ---
GO TOP
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO BOTTOM
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 15: CDX LNAME SKIP under ordered traversal ---
GO TOP
SKIP 5
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SKIP -2
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 16: CDX LNAME GO relative under ordered traversal ---
GO TOP
GO +8
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO -3
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 17: CDX LNAME boundary checks ascending ---
GO TOP
SKIP -1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO BOTTOM
SKIP 1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 18: GOTO absolute while ordered ---
GOTO 10
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 19: SEEK on active LNAME tag ---
GO TOP
SEEK ANDERSON
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5

ECHO --- SECTION 20: CDX LNAME descending endpoints ---
DESCEND
TOP
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5
BOTTOM
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 21: CDX LNAME descending relative movement ---
TOP
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SKIP 3
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SKIP -1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 22: CDX LNAME boundary checks descending ---
TOP
SKIP -1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
BOTTOM
SKIP 1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 23: Switch to FNAME tag ---
ASCEND
SET ORDER TO TAG FNAME
TOP
AREA
STATUS
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5

ECHO --- SECTION 24: SEEK on active FNAME tag ---
SEEK ADRIEN
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5

ECHO --- SECTION 25: GO / SKIP on FNAME order ---
GO TOP
GO +6
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SKIP -2
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO BOTTOM
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 26: FNAME boundary checks ---
GO TOP
SKIP -1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
GO BOTTOM
SKIP 1
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO --- SECTION 27: Switch to SID tag ---
ASCEND
SET ORDER TO TAG SID
TOP
AREA
STATUS
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SEEK 50000016
AREA
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO --- CLEANUP / RETURN TO NATURAL ---
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO 0
AREA
STATUS
TUPLE SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,MAJOR,GPA NEXT 5

ECHO CURSOR FAMILY REGRESSION COMPLETE